# Golden files compared byte-for-byte (well, line-for-line) against what this crate
# generates. The generators always emit LF; a checkout under `core.autocrlf=true` (Git for
# Windows' own installer default) would otherwise turn these into CRLF on disk, failing every
# comparison on a line-ending difference that has nothing to do with what is under test
# (issue #166). Pinned to LF regardless of any `core.autocrlf` setting, on any platform.
crates/sapphire-framework-service/tests/golden/* text eol=lf
